{
  "task": {
    "id": "Prob086_lfsr5",
    "spec": "\r\nI would like you to implement a module named TopModule with the following\r\ninterface. All input and output ports are one bit unless otherwise\r\nspecified.\r\n\r\n - input  clk\r\n - input  reset\r\n - output q (5 bits)\r\n\r\nA linear feedback shift register is a shift register usually with a few\r\nXOR gates to produce the next state of the shift register. A Galois LFSR\r\nis one particular arrangement that shifts right, where a bit position with\r\na \"tap\" is XORed with the LSB output bit (q[0]) to produce its next value,\r\nwhile bit positions without a tap shift right unchanged.  If the taps positions\r\nare carefully chosen, the LFSR can be made to be \"maximum-length\". A maximum-length\r\nLFSR of n bits cycles through 2**n-1 states before repeating (the all-zero state is\r\nnever reached).\r\n\r\nThe module should implement a 5-bit maximal-length Galois LFSR with taps\r\nat bit positions 5 and 3. The active-high synchronous reset should reset\r\nthe LFSR output to 1. Assume all sequential logic is triggered on the\r\npositive edge of the clock.\r\n\r\n",
    "interface": {
      "top": "TopModule",
      "ports": [
        {
          "name": "clk",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "reset",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "q",
          "direction": "output",
          "width": 5,
          "signed": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "constraints": "SystemVerilog, exactly one self-contained TopModule DUT. Inline all helper logic inside TopModule; do not define auxiliary modules. xczu3eg-sbva484-1-e; 5 ns synthesis clock; simulator seed 1. No reference dependencies, hierarchy outside the DUT, file access, includes or DPI."
  },
  "sample_id": "14b68ea0-8235-4dbe-a5a5-fd34d6622ede",
  "variant_id": "C",
  "current": {
    "revision_id": "46c5acad-cabe-4a5f-a869-e27bd880f9e5",
    "source_sha256": "036e3dc68cbf761d2710c3268a3ceb5f2ab6a04ee1ba24d197b831220d572836",
    "source": "module TopModule (\n    input  clk,\n    input  reset,\n    output reg [4:0] q\n);\n\n    always @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset) begin\n            q <= 5'b00001;\n        end else begin\n            q[4] <= q[3];\n            q[3] <= q[2] ^ q[0];\n            q[2] <= q[1];\n            q[1] <= q[0];\n            q[0] <= q[4] ^ q[0];\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n"
  },
